<title>USA: Thermadyne Holdings Corp Q3 loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Thermadyne Holdings Corp Q3 loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.82     loss	 $2.84</p>
<p> Net loss		  19,616     loss	28,554</p>
<p> Revs		     137,019		  102,536</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,780		   10,049</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago Q3 includes loss of $5.4 million from discontinued operations. 1996 Q3 includes loss of $946,000 on disposal of discontinued operations. Q3 includes amortization of goodwill of about $21 million vs $25.2 million.  </p>
<p>		     9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		  $ 5.38     loss	 $8.90</p>
<p> Net loss		  57,869     loss	89,157</p>
<p> Revs		     407,168		  312,324</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  10,748		   10,017</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 nine-month results include extraordinary loss of $0.35/shr related to writeoff of deferred financing costs in the Q2 and a net gain on the sale of its discontinued operations of $0.79/shr. 1996 nine-months include losses of $17.2 million from discontinued operations.</p>
</text>
